00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
From education to real civic careers
A source-first preparation tool for a learner and a human advisor. Captured app views; this is a captioned screenshot walkthrough.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Discover an official opportunity
Nine records include vacancies, intakes, ongoing pathways and one expired intake. They are not nine open jobs. Dates and source limits are visible.

3
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Understand the selected requirement
The Maryland administrative bulletin permits a 30-credit substitution. Fictional declarations support this selected route; other conditions remain unknown.

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:45,000
See what civic work has produced
NIH documents Gargi Mahadeshwar’s evidence-linked PDF tool. Portfolio exercises are our suggestions, not her artifacts or an endorsement.

5
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Prepare a real advisor handoff
The application generated an actual Markdown download with source links, fictional declarations, evidence notes and open questions. No application or message is sent.

6
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Test usefulness honestly
Proposed: 25 adult learners, 25 reviewed opportunities, 60 days. Economic budget $6,240. Independent participants n=0; no hiring gains claimed.
